    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.144",
      "skos:note": "Declaration criteria for a service must promote material increase in competition and public interest.",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "44CA(1) Meaning of declaration criteria"
      },
      "wasDerivedFrom": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf",
      "asserts": [
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-norm",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-5"
      ],
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:integrityHash": "1386e5942592487ed9211bab8687fe62f349c19377625ed003ba79dd61674570",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "realizedBy": "doc:competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-44ca-ss-1",
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "partOf": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) The declaration criteria for a service are:  (a) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote a material increase in competition in at least one market (whether or not in Australia), other than the market for the service; and",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Service declaration must promote material increase in competition and public interest.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The declaration criteria for a service are:  (a) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote a material increase in competition in at least one market (whether or not in Australia), other than the market for the service; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(c) that the facility is of national significance, having regard to:  (i) the size of the facility; or  (ii) the importance of the facility to constitutional trade or commerce; or  (iii) the importance of the facility to the national economy;",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Service declaration must meet facility size and importance criteria.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) that the facility is of national significance, having regard to:  (i) the size of the facility; or  (ii) the importance of the facility to constitutional trade or commerce; or  (iii) the importance of the facility to the national economy;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(d) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote the public interest.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Service declaration must promote public interest.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote the public interest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(b) that the facility that is used (or will be used) to provide the service could meet the total foreseeable demand in the market:  (i) over the period for which the service would be declared; and  (ii) at the least cost compared to any 2 or more facilities (which could include the first-mentioned facility);",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Service declaration must meet market demand criteria.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) that the facility that is used (or will be used) to provide the service could meet the total foreseeable demand in the market:  (i) over the period for which the service would be declared; and  (ii) at the least cost compared to any 2 or more facilities (which could include the first-mentioned facility);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44ca-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(a) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote a material increase in competition in at least one market (whether or not in Australia), other than the market for the service;",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Service declaration must promote material increase in competition.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) that access (or increased access) to the service, on reasonable terms and conditions, as a result of a declaration of the service would promote a material increase in competition in at least one market (whether or not in Australia), other than the market for the service;"
    },
