    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The designated Minister must be satisfied of certain matters.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The designated Minister must not decide that the service is ineligible to be a declared service unless he or she is satisfied of both of the following matters:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44lg-ss-5-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The designated Minister must be satisfied of at least one declaration criterion.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must",
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The designated Minister must not decide that the service is ineligible to be a declared service unless he or she is satisfied of both of the following matters:  (a) that the service is to be provided by means of the proposed facility when constructed;  (b) that he or she is not satisfied of at least one of the declaration criteria for the service to be provided by means of the proposed facility."
    },
