    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44x-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commission MUST consider the matter.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must consider matter",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) In making an interim determination, the Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to take into account a matter referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44x-ss-4-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commission MUST NOT consider the matter.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must not consider matter in making interim determination",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST NOT",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) In making an interim determination, the Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to take into account a matter referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44x-ss-4-logic-linearlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the Commission has a duty to consider the matter, then the Commission MUST consider the matter.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Duty to consider matter implies consideration of matter",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "⇒",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) In making an interim determination, the Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to take into account a matter referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-44x-ss-4-logic-linearlogic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the Commission does NOT consider the matter, then the Commission MUST NOT consider the matter.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Not considering matter implies duty not to consider matter",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "⇒",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) In making an interim determination, the Commission does not have a duty to consider whether to take into account a matter referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
